{"vid":"a1Sk2LgtJno","source":"a1Sk2LgtJno.en-en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"ARTHUR C. BROOKS: I'm a classic striver."},{"t":2,"txt":"I work really hard."},{"t":4,"txt":"I want to put points on the board every single day."},{"t":7.2,"txt":"You know what I'm bad at?"},{"t":9.6,"txt":"Leisure."},{"t":10.1,"txt":"Now, I know what you're thinking."},{"t":11.5,"txt":"Leisure is chilling on the beach."},{"t":13,"txt":"And you're probably not very good at leisure, either,"},{"t":14.9,"txt":"if you're watching this video."},{"t":16.2,"txt":"You're watching content from HBR because you want an edge, man."},{"t":20.6,"txt":"I completely get it."},{"t":21.6,"txt":"But here's where we're wrong, fellow strivers."},{"t":23.7,"txt":"Leisure is a serious business."},{"t":25.3,"txt":"[JAZZ MUSIC]"},{"t":28.7,"txt":"A very famous book written in the middle of the 20th century"},{"t":31.4,"txt":"called Leisure, the Basis of Culture, by Josef Pieper,"},{"t":35.3,"txt":"German philosopher-- he was a great philosopher."},{"t":37.9,"txt":"And he said that we need to be great at leisure."},{"t":41.6,"txt":"By that, he meant that we need to be strivers at leisure, too."},{"t":45.4,"txt":"And that meant not being lazy."},{"t":47.3,"txt":"He talked about leisure as being a serious thing"},{"t":50.1,"txt":"in which we're not compensated by the world,"},{"t":52.1,"txt":"but which enriches us and makes us better."},{"t":54.2,"txt":"You don't need work-life balance."},{"t":55.6,"txt":"You need work-life integration."},{"t":57.3,"txt":"And the way to do that, to be better at your job,"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"is also to be better at your \"not job.\""},{"t":62.5,"txt":"The three parts of leisure that make you truly excellent"},{"t":64.9,"txt":"are all about learning things you don't have to learn,"},{"t":68.6,"txt":"deepening your relationships for which nobody pays you, which"},{"t":71.9,"txt":"is to say, not on the clock, and becoming"},{"t":74.9,"txt":"spiritually or philosophically deeper than you once were."},{"t":78.5,"txt":"Those are the three areas of leisure"},{"t":80.1,"txt":"that you can dedicate yourself to to get better at"},{"t":83.2,"txt":"and watch your happiness and your effectiveness"},{"t":85.5,"txt":"and your productivity and your creativity truly grow."},{"t":88.6,"txt":"And those are great goals for any striver."},{"t":91.6,"txt":"I know you plan out your work."},{"t":93.6,"txt":"Every striver does."},{"t":94.9,"txt":"Every minute is accounted for, right?"},{"t":97.8,"txt":"And the trouble is that they don't like the time when they're"},{"t":100.4,"txt":"not working precisely because it's so unstructured,"},{"t":104.7,"txt":"feels like it's frittered away."},{"t":106.3,"txt":"I talk to people all the time who say, boy, at work,"},{"t":108.5,"txt":"I'm unbelievably productive."},{"t":109.8,"txt":"But then I come home, and I'm exhausted."},{"t":111.4,"txt":"And I just waste all my time-- zoom,"},{"t":113.6,"txt":"zoom, zoom-- scrolling through social media."},{"t":116.4,"txt":"And I feel bad about myself."},{"t":118,"txt":"The answer to that is to take seriously your leisure time"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"like you take your work."},{"t":123.3,"txt":"That means real assignments and real goals,"},{"t":126.4,"txt":"like having objectives that you're"},{"t":128.2,"txt":"trying to focus on to be better than you once"},{"t":130.8,"txt":"were so that you're looking forward to get home not to do"},{"t":133.5,"txt":"more work and not to fritter away your time on social media,"},{"t":136.2,"txt":"but to read that book that you've always wanted to read."},{"t":139.1,"txt":"I promise you that if you set aside The Brothers Karamazov"},{"t":143,"txt":"by Fyodor Dostoyevsky-- you probably always wanted"},{"t":145.2,"txt":"to read it."},{"t":145.7,"txt":"Everybody did."},{"t":146.9,"txt":"It's so great."},{"t":148.1,"txt":"It's a complete page-turner."},{"t":150.5,"txt":"And you say, as soon as I get home from work,"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"I'm going to dig into that book."},{"t":154.6,"txt":"That's something that has the dignity of every striver's work"},{"t":160.6,"txt":"calendar."},{"t":161.7,"txt":"And you can dedicate it to your leisure."},{"t":163.6,"txt":"And you can love both."},{"t":166.8,"txt":"You can go too far and suck all the joy out of this"},{"t":171.5,"txt":"if you say to yourself, I'm not going"},{"t":173.1,"txt":"to sleep until I've read 35 pages of The Brothers Karamazov"},{"t":177.7,"txt":"by Dostoyevsky, then pretty soon, you won't look forward"},{"t":181.6,"txt":"to it anymore."},{"t":182.5,"txt":"It has to be something that doesn't become a chore,"},{"t":184.9,"txt":"it doesn't become something that's"},{"t":186.3,"txt":"a task that sucks the meaning out of life, per se."},{"t":189.2,"txt":"One of the ways that you can test this"},{"t":191.8,"txt":"is to see whether or not you're truly getting enjoyment"},{"t":194.6,"txt":"from something."},{"t":196,"txt":"And if you are, then you're going"},{"t":197.4,"txt":"to want to be more structured about it."},{"t":199,"txt":"You're going to want to do it in a serious way."},{"t":200.5,"txt":"You're going to want to get after it."},{"t":201.9,"txt":"You're going to want to schedule it."},{"t":203.4,"txt":"But if it actually becomes something"},{"t":205.6,"txt":"that you're not enjoying anymore,"},{"t":207.3,"txt":"then you know that you've actually gone too far."},{"t":209.6,"txt":"That's how you figure it out, not too hard."},{"t":213.2,"txt":"Can leisure be unproductive?"},{"t":216.5,"txt":"The answer, according to Josef Pieper,"},{"t":218.8,"txt":"who wrote Leisure, the Basis of Culture,"},{"t":220.6,"txt":"is no because if you're doing something"},{"t":223.4,"txt":"that's inherently generative and good, that's productive."},{"t":226.3,"txt":"That doesn't mean it's work itself."},{"t":228.4,"txt":"You don't have to turn your leisure into a job."},{"t":231.3,"txt":"But it has to be something where you have personal growth."},{"t":234.8,"txt":"Maybe that's total and complete relaxation."},{"t":238.4,"txt":"Maybe that's going on a retreat, where you're"},{"t":240.6,"txt":"sitting in meditation or in prayer,"},{"t":243,"txt":"or you're getting serious about deepening your relationship"},{"t":246.1,"txt":"outside of the confines of any of your work responsibilities."},{"t":249.7,"txt":"But that's productive."},{"t":251.2,"txt":"It's just a new way of seeing what productivity actually is."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"ARTHUR"},{"t":0,"w":"C."},{"t":0,"w":"BROOKS:"},{"t":0,"w":"I'm"},{"t":0,"w":"a"},{"t":0,"w":"classic"},{"t":0,"w":"striver."},{"t":2.04,"w":"I"},{"t":2.04,"w":"work"},{"t":2.04,"w":"really"},{"t":2.04,"w":"hard."},{"t":4.04,"w":"I"},{"t":4.04,"w":"want"},{"t":4.04,"w":"to"},{"t":4.04,"w":"put"},{"t":4.04,"w":"points"},{"t":4.04,"w":"on"},{"t":4.04,"w":"the"},{"t":4.04,"w":"board"},{"t":4.04,"w":"every"},{"t":4.04,"w":"single"},{"t":4.04,"w":"day."},{"t":7.24,"w":"You"},{"t":7.24,"w":"know"},{"t":7.24,"w":"what"},{"t":7.24,"w":"I'm"},{"t":7.24,"w":"bad"},{"t":7.24,"w":"at?"},{"t":9.6,"w":"Leisure."},{"t":10.1,"w":"Now,"},{"t":10.1,"w":"I"},{"t":10.1,"w":"know"},{"t":10.1,"w":"what"},{"t":10.1,"w":"you're"},{"t":10.1,"w":"thinking."},{"t":11.475,"w":"Leisure"},{"t":11.475,"w":"is"},{"t":11.475,"w":"chilling"},{"t":11.475,"w":"on"},{"t":11.475,"w":"the"},{"t":11.475,"w":"beach."},{"t":13.02,"w":"And"},{"t":13.02,"w":"you're"},{"t":13.02,"w":"probably"},{"t":13.02,"w":"not"},{"t":13.02,"w":"very"},{"t":13.02,"w":"good"},{"t":13.02,"w":"at"},{"t":13.02,"w":"leisure,"},{"t":13.02,"w":"either,"},{"t":14.94,"w":"if"},{"t":14.94,"w":"you're"},{"t":14.94,"w":"watching"},{"t":14.94,"w":"this"},{"t":14.94,"w":"video."},{"t":16.19,"w":"You're"},{"t":16.19,"w":"watching"},{"t":16.19,"w":"content"},{"t":16.19,"w":"from"},{"t":16.19,"w":"HBR"},{"t":16.19,"w":"because"},{"t":16.19,"w":"you"},{"t":16.19,"w":"want"},{"t":16.19,"w":"an"},{"t":16.19,"w":"edge,"},{"t":16.19,"w":"man."},{"t":20.58,"w":"I"},{"t":20.58,"w":"completely